<title>USA: Southern Energy Homes to repurchase stock.</title>
<headline>Southern Energy Homes to repurchase stock.</headline>
<dateline>ADDISON, Ala. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Energy Homes Inc Thursday said the company intends to purchase up to two million shares of its common stock in the next year.</p>
<p>Southern Energy Homes is a producer of manufactured homes sold in 30 states, primarily throughout the Southeast and south central U.S. It also sells manufactured homes on a retail basis through nine retail centers.</p>
</text>
